      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "I add my congratulations to the authors for this path breaking work. In this discussion, I shall expand on",
      "bbox": [
        48.09086608886719,
        192.01683044433594,
        443.607666015625,
        200.32867431640625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "comments in the paper linking the methods introduced to a generic framework for Markov chain Monte",
      "bbox": [
        48.09086608886719,
        201.97938537597656,
        443.6122131347656,
        210.29122924804688
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Carlo (MCMC) methods which can be applied to missing data problems and other situations where the",
