        48.09086608886719,
        211.9419403076172,
        443.60772705078125,
        220.2537841796875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "target density is unavailable but can be estimated unbiasedly by using an auxiliary variable construction.",
      "bbox": [
        48.09086608886719,
        221.9044952392578,
        443.6114196777344,
        230.21633911132812
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "This work can be found in Andrieu and Roberts (2009), generalizing an idea that was introduced in",
