    },
    {
      "text": "tionary distribution of θ under the scheme is typically not π (if it exists at all). However, the generalized",
      "bbox": [
        48.089698791503906,
        484.9498291015625,
        443.6038513183594,
        494.0148620605469
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "importance Metropolis–Hastings approach has the following invariant distribution:",
